      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──我不是正要开始说吗？\n让全阿船感动落泪，\n一个伫立在公园的孤独少年的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ee32b0955fcce9a0534756e664bccba2e643b51f8ba98bbf7c17b06aa63ed7",
